        {
          "text": "Na kũkethĩwa mũthenya ũsu, atĩ ũtialo wa Isilaeli, na ala avonoku ma nyũmba ya Yakovo, matikamwĩkwatya ĩngĩ ũla wamakũnie, ĩndĩ makamwĩkwatya Yeova, Ũla Mũtheu wa Isilaeli, na w’o. ",
