        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova wa nguthu akamũkĩlĩlya mũsalisa, o tondũ kweekiwe kũawanĩ kwa Mitiani ĩvianĩ ya Olevi: na ndata yake ĩkeethĩwa ĩũlũ wa ũkanga, na akamyũkĩlya o tondũ kweekiwe Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
